sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend
    participant Email as Nodemailer
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant Bus as EventBus

    User->>FE: enter username, password, email, role
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/auth/register
    BE->>BE: validate input (Zod)
    BE->>BE: hash password (bcrypt)
    BE->>DB: create user record
    DB-->>BE: user
    BE->>BE: generate access + refresh tokens
    BE->>DB: store hashed refresh token
    BE->>Bus: emit USER_REGISTERED
    BE-->>FE: 201 Created (access token + Set-Cookie refresh)

    User->>FE: request email verification
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/auth/email/send
    BE->>BE: generate email verification JWT (24h)
    BE->>Email: send verification link
    Email-->>User: email with /verify/:token link
    BE-->>FE: 200 OK

    User->>FE: click verification link
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/auth/email/verify/:token
    BE->>BE: verify JWT (purpose=email_verify)
    BE->>DB: set emailVerified=true
    BE->>Bus: emit EMAIL_VERIFIED
    BE-->>FE: 200 OK
    FE-->>User: verified

    Note over User,FE: Subsequent logins use POST /api/v1/auth/login (username + password)
